Description: Take control of our own logind session, not the seat's active one
 LogindConsoleServices used seat0's ActiveSession. A compositor restarted
 inside its login (after a crash) while the user is on another VT then
 took control of the foreground session: when the user switched back it
 was paused and, as its own session's Active changes were never watched,
 never resumed. Use XDG_SESSION_ID (logind Manager.GetSession) when it is
 set and fall back to the active session otherwise.
Author: Umoja developers
Forwarded: not yet (bug report drafted in packaging/mir/upstream-bugs/)
Last-Update: 2026-11-09
---
